[{"id":2707538108,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hYcC8","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nFor completeness' sake, here's a benchmark between `master`, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104450 and this PR applied on top of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104450:\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing an optimized editor build (`production=yes lto=full`).\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ hyperfine -iw1 -m25 \"bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.master --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\" \"bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.font-load-once --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\" \"bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64 --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\"\r\nBenchmark 1: bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.master --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      4.090 s ±  0.274 s    [User: 2.497 s, System: 0.609 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.251 s …  4.299 s    25 runs\r\n \r\nBenchmark 2: bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.font-load-once --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      3.810 s ±  0.091 s    [User: 2.196 s, System: 0.611 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.404 s …  3.868 s    25 runs\r\n \r\nBenchmark 3: bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64 --path /tmp/4 -e --quit   <---- This PR\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      3.708 s ±  0.322 s    [User: 2.109 s, System: 0.591 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    2.795 s …  4.235 s    25 runs\r\n \r\nSummary\r\n  bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64 --path /tmp/4 -e --quit ran\r\n    1.03 ± 0.09 times faster than bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.font-load-once --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\r\n    1.10 ± 0.12 times faster than bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.master --path /tmp/4 -e --quit\r\n```","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104455#pullrequestreview-2707538108","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104455","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104455#pullrequestreview-2707538108"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104455"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-21T23:23:27Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2707536968,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hYbxI","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b